                                "sense_id": "a7f79bf3-58bd-3a82-9422-af4ae2a145b1",
                                "text": "Seeing sashed windows in town, he got them into his own house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d8ac96c5-071f-44af-b8de-7d7120119e3a",
                                "sense_id": "a7f79bf3-58bd-3a82-9422-af4ae2a145b1",
                                "text": "A skylight of moderate dimension was overhead and at each end of the oblong space were two sashed port-hole windows easily convertible back into embrasures for short carronades."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5b2a2d8e-0a0e-3bd5-95a4-d41c3349be42",
