                                "sense_id": "5b2a2d8e-0a0e-3bd5-95a4-d41c3349be42",
                                "text": "[…] Certainly / there was impressive swagger in that / ready, high-elbowed stance; belted / and sashed in threaded dragon teeth / they waited in self-imposed restraint— / fine ornament on power unassailable— / for their cue"
